# Long-horizon simulation artifacts. Keep the small Markdown summary reviewable,
# but never commit full checkpoints, JSON telemetry, or historical map dumps.
validation/long-horizon/*
!validation/long-horizon/BENCHMARK.md

# Political calibration artifacts. Keep the Markdown summary reviewable while
# leaving full event telemetry local.
validation/politics-calibration/*
!validation/politics-calibration/POLITICS_CALIBRATION.md

